# fact: the 350 mm "Bedroom 4" label is centred at (1137.5, 2330), about 1730 mm wide at 0.55 em per
#   character (x 270-2000), and the bed spans x 1650-3150, y 900-2900: about 350 x 350 mm of the label lies on the bed
plan "Room label over the bed" {
  units mm
  grid 50
  paper A4 landscape
  scale 1:100
  wall id=shell exterior thickness 200 { (0,0) (3250,0) (3250,3000) (0,3000) close }
  room id=r_bed4 at (0,0) size 3250x3000 label "Bedroom 4" uses bedroom
  door at (0,1500) width 800 wall shell hinge left swing in
  window at (3250,1000) width 1600 wall shell
  furniture bed at (1650,900) size 1500x2000
  furniture wardrobe at (100,100) size 1800x600
}
